c><00:00:01.044><c>error </c><00:00:01.045><c>is </c><00:00:01.046><c>0 </c><00:00:01.047><c>which  </c><00:00:01.048><c>essentially </c><00:00:01.049><c>means </c><00:00:01.050><c>that </c><00:00:01.051><c>our </c><00:00:01.052><c>estimate </c><00:00:01.053><c>is  </c><00:00:01.054><c>going </c><00:00:01.055><c>to </c><00:00:01.056><c>be </c><00:00:01.057><c>equal </c><00:00:01.058><c>to </c><00:00:01.059><c>the </c><00:00:01.060><c>unknown </c><00:00:01.061><c>value  </c><00:00:01.062><c>so </c><00:00:01.063><c>the </c><00:00:01.064><c>special </c><00:00:01.065><c>case </c><00:00:01.066><c>of </c><00:00:01.067><c>a </c><00:00:01.068><c>unit  </c><00:00:01.069><c>correlation </c><00:00:01.070><c>in </c><00:00:01.071><c>absolute </c><00:00:01.072><c>value  </c><00:00:01.073><c>corresponds </c><00:00:01.074><c>to </c><00:00:01.075><c>a </c><00:00:01.076><c>case </c><00:00:01.077><c>where </c><00:00:01.078><c>we </c><00:00:01.079><c>can  </c><00:00:01.080><c>perfectly </c><00:00:01.081><c>estimate </c><00:00:01.082><c>theta </c><00:00:01.083><c>using </c><00:00:01.084><c>a </c><00:00:01.085><c>linear  </c><00:00:01.086><c>estimator  </c><00:00:01.087><c>so </c><00:00:01.088><c>to </c><00:00:01.089><c>summarize </c><00:00:01.090><c>the </c><00:00:01.091><c>correlation  </c><00:00:01.092><c>coefficient </c><00:00:01.093><c>plays </c><00:00:01.094><c>a </c><00:00:01.095><c>crucial </c><00:00:01.096><c>role </c><00:00:01.097><c>in  </c><00:00:01.098><c>linear </c><00:00:01.099><c>least </c><00:00:01.100><c>squares </c><00:00:01.101><c>estimation </c><00:00:01.102><c>it  </c><00:00:01.103><c>determines </c><00:00:01.104><c>the </c><00:00:01.105><c>form </c><00:00:01.106><c>of </c><00:00:01.107><c>the </c><00:00:01.108><c>estimator </c><00:00:01.109><c>and  </c><00:00:01.110><c>also </c><00:00:01.111><c>it </c><00:00:01.112><c>determines </c><00:00:01.113><c>how </c><00:00:01.114><c>much </c><00:00:01.115><c>the  </c><00:00:01.116><c>uncertainty </c><00:00:01.117><c>in </c>